Package: viar-scanner
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libpng16-16, libtcl8.6, libtk8.6, libx11-6, libxau6, libxdmcp6, libxext6, libxft2, libxrender1, libxss1, v4l-utils
Maintainer: VIAR Scanner local package
Description: VIAR-500A document scanner for Astra Linux
 Standalone graphical application for V4L2 capture, automatic page detection,
 perspective correction, Sauvola binarization and multi-page PDF export.
 Python and all application-level dependencies are bundled in the package.
